  "/convert/html-to-txt/": "HTML to TXT Converter. Strip an HTML page down to clean plain text. Perfect for extracting article content from saved web pages without the tags, scripts or styling. TL;DR: Drop a HTML file, get a TXT file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About HTML: HTML pages mix content with markup — tags, scripts, styles. Sometimes you just want the words. About TXT: Plain text is the universal readable format: no formatting, no code, just the content in reading order.",
