  "/convert/json-to-csv/": "JSON to CSV Converter. Convert a JSON array of objects into a CSV spreadsheet that opens in Excel and Google Sheets. The fastest way to make API data human-readable. TL;DR: Drop a JSON file, get a CSV file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About JSON: JSON is the data format of APIs and JavaScript — nested, precise, and unreadable to non-developers. About CSV: CSV is the spreadsheet format: rows and columns that open in Excel and Google Sheets, readable by anyone.",
