  "/convert/json-to-yaml/": "JSON to YAML Converter. Convert JSON config into readable YAML for Docker Compose, Kubernetes, CI pipelines and app settings. TL;DR: Drop a JSON file, get a YAML file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About JSON: JSON is precise but noisy — braces, quotes and commas everywhere make it tiring to read and edit by hand. About YAML: YAML is the human-friendly config format: clean indentation, no clutter — the native language of Docker Compose and Kubernetes.",
