  "/convert/srt-to-ssa/": "SRT to SSA Converter. Convert SRT to SSA, the classic SubStation Alpha format still used by older fansub tooling and players. TL;DR: Drop a SRT file, get a SSA file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About SRT: SRT is the modern plain-text subtitle standard — simple, universal, style-free. About SSA: SSA is the classic SubStation Alpha format from the fansub era — still required by some older encoders and scripts.",
  "/convert/ssa-to-srt/": "SSA to SRT Converter. Convert SSA subtitles to plain SRT for universal player support. Text and timing preserved, styling removed. TL;DR: Drop a SSA file, get a SRT file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About SSA: SSA is the older styled subtitle format — expressive, but increasingly unsupported outside niche players. About SRT: SRT is the safe universal choice: every player, editor and platform from the last 20 years accepts it.",
  "/convert/vtt-to-ass/": "WebVTT to ASS Converter. Convert WebVTT web captions to styled ASS subtitles for desktop players and fansub workflows. TL;DR: Drop a WebVTT file, get a ASS file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About WebVTT: WebVTT is built for browsers, with only basic styling. Desktop fansub workflows expect much more. About ASS: ASS brings full styling to your captions: fonts, colors, positioning and effects for players like VLC and MPV.",
  "/convert/ass-to-vtt/": "ASS to WebVTT Converter. Convert styled ASS subtitles to WebVTT for use in HTML5 video players on the web. TL;DR: Drop a ASS file, get a WebVTT file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About ASS: ASS is the desktop styling king — but browsers don’t speak it. Web video needs WebVTT. About WebVTT: WebVTT is the native web caption format, working with the track element in every browser.",
  "/convert/vtt-to-ssa/": "WebVTT to SSA Converter. Convert WebVTT captions to SSA format for legacy subtitling tools that expect SubStation Alpha. TL;DR: Drop a WebVTT file, get a SSA file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About WebVTT: WebVTT is modern and web-native; SSA is a legacy desktop format. Rarely do they meet — but some old tools insist. About SSA: SSA satisfies those legacy encoders and scripts that predate both WebVTT and ASS.",
  "/convert/ssa-to-vtt/": "SSA to WebVTT Converter. Convert SSA subtitles to WebVTT so they play as native captions in HTML5 video. TL;DR: Drop a SSA file, get a WebVTT file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About SSA: SSA belongs to the desktop fansub era; the web never adopted it. About WebVTT: WebVTT brings those subtitles to browsers as native track captions.",
