  "/convert/ssa-to-ass/": "SSA to ASS Converter. Upgrade SSA subtitles to modern ASS format, unlocking better styling support in current players and editors. TL;DR: Drop a SSA file, get a ASS file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About SSA: SSA was great for its time, but ASS does everything it does, better. About ASS: ASS is the modern styled subtitle standard — better tooling, better player support, more features.",
  "/convert/mp4-to-mp3/": "MP4 to MP3 Converter. Extract the audio from any MP4 video as a high-quality MP3. Perfect for saving podcast audio, lectures, music and voice from video files. TL;DR: Drop a MP4 file, get a MP3 file back in seconds. Free forever, no sign-up — and your file never leaves your device because the conversion runs in your browser. About MP4: MP4 is the universal video container — video and audio bundled together. Often you only want the audio. About MP3: MP3 is the universal audio format: tiny files that play on every device, car stereo and app ever made.",
