  "/categories/image/": "Image Converters. Free online image converters that run entirely in your browser. Change PNG to JPG, WebP to PNG, HEIC to JPG and more — resize and rotate images in bulk, or create PNG to PDF, JPG to PDF, WebP to PDF, GIF to PDF, BMP to PDF and HEIC to PDF documents — your photos are never uploaded anywhere.",
